---
permalink: ./arknights-integrated-strategies.html
title: 明日方舟 · 集成战略世界线
bodyClass: world-arknights ark-is-index-page
pageType: arknights-is-index
worldId: arknights
cssFiles:
  - base.css
  - nav.css
  - worlds.css
  - arknights-world.css
  - responsive.css
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<article class="is-index" id="is-index" aria-labelledby="is-index-title">
  <header class="is-index-hero">
    <a class="ark-backlink" href="./arknights.html">← TERRA / 泰拉观测入口</a>
    <div class="is-index-signal" aria-hidden="true">
      {% for topic in arknightsTopics %}<i style="--n:{{ loop.index }}"></i>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="terra-kicker">INTEGRATED STRATEGIES / ARCHIVE ARRAY</p>
    <h1 id="is-index-title">集成战略<span>世界线</span></h1>
    <p>七个主题按发布顺序收录；各主题的时序以对应专题资料为准。</p>
    <div class="is-index-meta"><span>07 TOPICS</span><span>28 CURRENT ENDINGS</span><span>REVIEWED 2026-08-23</span></div>
  </header>

  <div class="is-topic-grid" data-is-index aria-live="polite">
    {% for topic in arknightsTopics %}
    <a class="is-index-card" href="./arknights-is-{{ topic.slug }}.html" data-context="{{ topic.id }}">
      <span class="is-index-number">IS-0{{ topic.order }}</span>
      <span class="is-index-state">{% if topic.status == 'updating' %}LIVE / 正在核验{% else %}ARCHIVED / 已收录{% endif %}</span>
      <strong>{{ topic.name }}</strong>
      <p>{{ topic.synopsis }}</p>
      <i>查看主题 →</i>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <footer class="is-index-note">
    <strong>SPOILER NOTICE</strong>
    <p>进入主题后会显示剧情转折与全部已收录结局。</p>
  </footer>
</article>
{% endblock %}
